<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Robertson ups DSC Comms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Robertson ups DSC Comms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens analyst Tim Savageaux upgraded his rating on DSC Communications to buy from long-term attractive, the brokerage said.</p>
<p>The analyst was considering revising his estimates later on Friday, his office said.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, ((212-859-1712))</p>
</text>
